  questions:
  - questionText: "  can you guess this? \\n \U0001F6E9\uFE0F\u2615 \U0001F333\U0001F333"
    correctAnswers:
    - plant trees
    hint: One tree absorbs\n 22 kgs of CO2 each year
    knowledgeFact: fact1
  - questionText: "  can you guess this? \\n REDUCE \U0001F697\U0001F9B4 \U0001F463"
    correctAnswers:
    - carbon footprint
    hint: \n 10-15% of global emissions \n come from deforestation! \n How do we
      bring that \n number down
    knowledgeFact: fact11
  - questionText: ' <size=180>Waste</size> <size=100>Waste</size> <size=60>Waste</size>
      <size=30>Waste</size>'
    correctAnswers:
    - reduce waste
    - waste reduction
    - waste reduce
    hint: This helps to protect\n marine animals
    knowledgeFact: fact2
  - questionText: "  can you guess this? \\n \U0001F914\U0001F49A\U0001F3AC\U0001F49A "
    correctAnswers:
    - think green act green
    hint: What thought can save up to 30% \n of your electricity annually.
    knowledgeFact: fact3
  - questionText: " <size=60>\"I\u2019m clean and green, \\n a planet\u2019s dream,\\n
      I work with the sun, wind, \\nand stream\". What am I?</size>"
    correctAnswers:
    - renewable energy
    hint: Solar Energy
    knowledgeFact: fact4
  - questionText: " <size=60>\"I don\u2019t drink gas, \\nI don\u2019t need a snack,
      \\n Just plug me in, and \\n I\u2019m back on track.\"What am I? </size>"
    correctAnswers:
    - EV
    - electric car
    - electric vehicle
    hint: Tesla
    knowledgeFact: fact5
  - questionText: "  can you guess this? \\n \u2B07\U0001F4A7"
    correctAnswers:
    - save water
    hint: What action keeps us \n from running dry?
    knowledgeFact: fact6
  - questionText: "  can you guess this? \\n \U0001F4A7 is \U0001F343"
    correctAnswers:
    - water is life
    hint: \n <1% of Earth's water is \n accessible for human use
    knowledgeFact: fact7
  - questionText: "  can you guess this? \\n \U0001F6B2\u21A9  \u2795\u2705 "
    correctAnswers:
    - recycle plastic
    hint: Pfand
    knowledgeFact: fact8
  - questionText: '  Unscramble this: \n  RNWTRAIRAE VTSGEHRIAN '
    correctAnswers:
    - rainwater harvesting
    hint: This can collect up to \n 600 gallons water
    knowledgeFact: fact9
  - questionText: '  Unscramble this: \n PTCRETO ILFEWDLI'
